Tests for the Lumen firmware. PlatformIO picks the folder through test_filter in platformio.ini.

test_native/
  Host tests for the pure code that the native env builds
  (lumen_type_validation.cpp, lumen_system_utils.cpp).
  Run: pio test -e native

test_esp32/
  On-device tests. They need an ESP32 with the BH1750 and DHT11 wired as in REFERENCE.md.
  Some tests write to NVS and start Wi-Fi.
  Run:        pio test -e lumen_esp32
  Build only: pio test -e lumen_esp32 --without-uploading --without-testing

PlatformIO unit testing docs:
https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
